Package: devwidgets
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Marvin <nefer.labrada@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, librsvg2-common
Recommends: openssh-client, git
Suggests: gh, docker.io
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/suarezsp/dev-widgets
Description: system and project monitor for developers
 A GTK 4 dashboard with the sizes of the DevWidgets macOS widgets:
 CPU, memory, disk and network with history, the busiest processes,
 the Git and GitHub state of a project, Docker containers, listening
 ports and SSH servers. Alerts become desktop notifications and a
 StatusNotifierItem tray icon shows a summary where the panel
 supports it.
